[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-024
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Monitoring is for administrators only
STATEMENT: >>>
The call log, price and cost endpoints and pages answer administrators and refuse regular users with HTTP 403.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_monitoring.py: test_monitoring_endpoints_are_admin_only
backend/tests/test_web_pages.py: test_regular_user_is_kept_out_of_admin_pages
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-090
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-025
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Every Gemini call is recorded
STATEMENT: >>>
A message with two tool rounds gives three records linked to that message, with the token counts (thinking and cached tokens included) from ``usageMetadata``; a failing call and a timeout give an ``error`` record; an answer without text or tool call gives an ``empty`` record; a failing log write does not change the reply.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_monitoring.py: test_each_round_is_recorded_with_tokens, test_failed_call_is_recorded, test_empty_answer_is_recorded, test_log_failure_does_not_break_chat
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-091
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-026
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Debug content only while the debug log is on
STATEMENT: >>>
With the debug log off a record has no request or response; with it on, both are stored in full and the API key appears in neither; the settings page shows the notice.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_monitoring.py: test_no_content_while_debug_off, test_full_content_while_debug_on, test_api_key_is_never_stored
backend/tests/test_web_pages.py: test_ai_settings_page_shows_debug_notice
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-092
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-027
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Debug content is removed
STATEMENT: >>>
The cleanup job removes content older than the retention period and keeps the tokens; the administrator can clear all content; clearing a conversation removes that user's content only; deleting a person keeps the tokens without the link and the content.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_monitoring.py: test_retention_removes_old_content, test_admin_clears_all_content, test_clearing_conversation_removes_own_content, test_deleting_person_keeps_costs
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-093
  ROLE: Verifies

