[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-030
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Cost calculation
STATEMENT: >>>
A call uses the price valid on its day (also around a price change at midnight Europe/Amsterdam), thinking tokens are priced as output, and a call without a price counts as zero and is reported as unpriced.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_ai_monitoring.py: test_cost_uses_price_of_call_day, test_thinking_tokens_cost_as_output, test_unpriced_calls_are_counted
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-096
  ROLE: Verifies

